        "name": "USN-6037-1",
        "description": "ZeddYu Lu discovered that the FTP client from Apache Commons Net trusted the host from PASV responses by default. A remote attacker with a malicious FTP server could redirect the client to another server, which could possibly result in leaked information about services running on the private network of the client.",
